            <objectUse>[BRDP-AH-34203JP] For the TIGER program, only MI Codes “JP” and “02” can be used for data modules production. In addition, MI Codes “AHTDGEN” and “S1000D” are used for BREX layering. (3.4.2 Model identifier Code (MI))</objectUse>
