          <structureObjectRule id="BRDP-AH-41318JP">
            <objectPath allowedObjectFlag="2">/dmodule/identAndStatusSection/dmStatus/originator/enterpriseName</objectPath>
            <objectUse>[BRDP-AH-41318JP] For the Tiger program, the content of the element &lt;originator&gt; is the NCAGE of the company who translate the Data Module for a translated Data Module. For Airbus Helicopter, the values are: F0210 for French, 274BB for Spanish, and C0418 for German. (4.1.3 Rules for Translation)</objectUse>
